  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day15
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 15
  storyText: "We woke up this morning and someone said: \"Yesterday was Valentine's
    Day.\" We all went quiet. None of us remembered. Not a single person. A year
    ago, we would've been annoyed by couples everywhere, posts on social media, chocolate
    on sale. Now? Zombies don't care about Valentine's. Neither do we. The only heart
    we're worried about is still beating in our chests. The ducks probably had a
    better Valentine's than us. At least they still have each other. We have instant
    noodles and a locked door. Happy late Valentine's. Hope yours was better. Ours
    was just another day of trying not to die.\r"
